# KDE Connect opens network ports for phone pairing, which a security-focused
# system should not do unasked; Konqueror would be a second browser; Kup is a
# backup tray app that sits in the bar. desktop-base is Debian's artwork
# (boot splash, user picture, login background) and would compete with Wild
# OS's. xwaylandvideobridge puts a "Wayland to X11 Video Bridge" window and
# tray icon on screen whenever an older app shares the screen. People can
# install any of the apps from the Store.
Conflicts:
 kdeconnect,
 konqueror,
 kup-backup,
 lxqt-notificationd,
 desktop-base,
 sddm-theme-debian-breeze,
 xwaylandvideobridge,
